cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Nếu bạn dùng mã hoặc kết quả của repo này, vui lòng trích dẫn như dưới đây."
title: "imdb-sentiment-revisited: Aspect-based sentiment analysis of IMDb movie reviews"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction and improvement of BERT+BiLSTM for binary IMDb sentiment classification
  (fine-tuned RoBERTa-large, 96.74% Macro-F1), followed by aspect-based sentiment analysis over
  six aspects with silver labels from a local Qwen3-8B (fine-tuned RoBERTa-large, 74.19% Macro-F1
  against the silver labels).
